Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:52.07,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Rain rain come wash away the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.07,0:20:55.49,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}With demons in my head
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.49,0:21:01.12,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Vengeance is the only way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.92,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}We had love before the end
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:17.76,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}We had trust, belief and friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:19.59,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Maybe something more
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.59,0:21:22.51,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,720)\blur2\fax-0.1}Maybe something less
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:26.31,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}This is how I make amends
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.31,0:21:29.23,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}For the light I turn to darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.23,0:21:32.90,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Shedding blood until it’s done
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:42.49,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}There’s no other way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.49,0:21:45.16,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}To end this pain and sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:48.33,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to that place
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:50.92,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.29,0:21:54.04,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}How could I ever forgive
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:56.75,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}When I cannot forget
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:59.63,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to that place
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:02.34,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.73,0:22:12.10,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}I’ll make you beg
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:15.15,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Make you pray
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.57,0:22:17.03,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Until your heart stops
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.03,0:22:17.94,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Until your heart stops
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:21.03,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}You’ll be wishing you were dead
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.03,0:22:23.74,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Because an eye or a tooth
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.74,0:22:26.33,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Won’t be all that you lose
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.33,0:22:32.21,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}I’ll make you pay for what you did
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.63,0:22:38.84,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}For what you did
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.09,0:22:45.39,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}There’s no other way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.97,0:22:48.51,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}To end this pain and sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.89,0:22:51.31,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to that place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:54.19,ED_EN_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.73,0:20:52.07,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}雨 雨冲洗掉这痛苦
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.07,0:20:55.49,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}被恶魔支配一般
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.49,0:21:01.12,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}只有选择复仇
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.92,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}结束之前我们曾拥有爱
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.92,0:21:17.76,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}曾拥有信任 拥有信仰与友情
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.76,0:21:19.59,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}或许在此之上
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.59,0:21:22.51,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,720)\blur2\fax-0.1}或许在此之下
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.51,0:21:26.31,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}这就是我的改过
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.31,0:21:29.23,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}追寻光明我投向黑暗
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.23,0:21:32.90,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}浴血战斗至最后一刻
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.74,0:21:42.49,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}我别无选择
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.49,0:21:45.16,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}为了告别这痛苦与悲伤
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.16,0:21:48.33,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}带我去那边
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.33,0:21:50.92,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}带我去明天
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.29,0:21:54.04,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}我如何原谅
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.04,0:21:56.75,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}如果我不能忘记
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.09,0:21:59.63,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}带我去那边
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.92,0:22:02.34,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}带我去明天
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.73,0:22:12.10,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}我会让你乞求
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.10,0:22:15.15,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}让你祈祷
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.57,0:22:17.03,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}直至心脏停止
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.03,0:22:17.94,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}直至心脏停止
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.94,0:22:21.03,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}你将会求死不得
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.03,0:22:23.74,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}因为以牙还牙
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.74,0:22:26.33,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}不过只是开始而已
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.33,0:22:32.21,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}终究会让你血债血偿
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.63,0:22:38.84,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}付出代价
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.09,0:22:45.39,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}我别无选择
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.97,0:22:48.51,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}为了告别这痛苦与悲伤
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.89,0:22:51.31,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}带我去那边
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.64,0:22:54.19,ED_CH_EP01,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}带我去明天
